# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file").
# One logic tick per entry: a 10-bit active-high key mask in hex.
# A 001, B 002, Select 004, Start 008, Right 010, Left 020, Up 040,
# Down 080, R 100, L 200. "MASK*N" is the same mask for N ticks.
# Ticks after the last entry have mask 000.
#
# boot300: boot with no keys, press A for 2 ticks at tick 200 (the health and
# safety screen), then no keys to tick 299.
000*200
001*2
000*98
